</tbody>
</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="S6.T3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Impact of VLM backbone choice on accuracy (%).</span> Using InternVL2-8B for automaton construction results in the highest accuracy when evaluated with GPT-4o.</figcaption>
</figure>
